{
 "source": "m_002001.bin",
 "format": "mz-scene",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x11d0",
   "off": 4560,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "徳川家が\\n江戸幕府を開き\\n二百余年の時が過ぎた――",
   "en": "More than two\\nhundred years\\nhad passed since\\nthe Tokugawa\\nclan founded the\\nEdo shogunate--",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0424"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x1214",
   "off": 4628,
   "max": 72,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "いく度ものうつり世を\\n重ねてきた日の本は　今\\n暗い病に冒されつつあった",
   "en": "Having\\nweathered age\\nafter age,\\nJapan was now\\nfalling prey to\\na dark sickness.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0425"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x126c",
   "off": 4716,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "幕府の進める泰平化\\nそしてその政策をめぐる\\n様々な攻防",
   "en": "The pacification\\npushed by the\\nshogunate, and\\nall manner of\\nstruggles over\\nthat policy...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0426"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x12b4",
   "off": 4788,
   "max": 76,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "誰もが　漠然とした\\n不安をかかえながら\\n見えない明日を\\n模索していた……",
   "en": "Everyone carried\\na vague unease as\\nthey groped for a\\ntomorrow they\\ncould not see...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0427"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x1bb8",
   "off": 7096,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "こちらでしたか\\n慶喜様",
   "en": "So this is where\\nyou were,\\nYoshinobu-sama.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0428"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x245c",
   "off": 9308,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "直弼か……",
   "en": "Naosuke, is it...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0429"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x2b48",
   "off": 11080,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "今夜の三日月は\\nとりわけ美しいと\\n思わないかい？",
   "en": "Don't you think\\ntonight's crescent\\nmoon is especially\\nbeautiful?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x042a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x2ffc",
   "off": 12284,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "はい",
   "en": "Indeed.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x042b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x3484",
   "off": 13444,
   "max": 64,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ゆらめく月の光が\\nまるで　ちっぽけな予を\\nあざけているようだ",
   "en": "The flickering\\nmoonlight almost\\nseems to mock\\nhow small I am.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x042c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x3944",
   "off": 14660,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "滅相も\\nござりません",
   "en": "Nothing of the\\nsort, my lord.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x042d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x3ddc",
   "off": 15836,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "で　どうしたんだい？\\nこんな夜更けに",
   "en": "So, what is it? At\\nthis late hour.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x042e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x4694",
   "off": 18068,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "例のモノの\\n行方につきまして……",
   "en": "It concerns the\\nwhereabouts\\nof that item...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x042f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x4f1c",
   "off": 20252,
   "max": 28,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "例のモノ……\\nああ　うん",
   "en": "That item...\\nAh, yes.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0430"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x53b4",
   "off": 21428,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "比叡山の僧たちに方位を\\n占わせましたところ",
   "en": "I had the monks\\nof Mount Hiei\\ndivine the\\ndirections...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0431"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x53f0",
   "off": 21488,
   "max": 60,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "大宇陀に散った\\n五つの片魂\\n（ピースソウル）\\nそのすべてが",
   "en": "...and they\\nfound that the\\nfive Piece\\nSouls scattered\\nfar and wide...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0432"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x543c",
   "off": 21564,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "この京に集まりつつある\\nとの結果が\\n出てございます",
   "en": "...are all\\ngathering\\nhere in Kyoto.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0433"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x5bf8",
   "off": 23544,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "へえ",
   "en": "Huh.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0434"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x607c",
   "off": 24700,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "あんまり興味が\\nなかったけど",
   "en": "I wasn't all that\\ninterested, but...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0435"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x6720",
   "off": 26400,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それは　ちょっと\\n面白いかもしれないね",
   "en": "...that might be\\na little amusing.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0436"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x6e68",
   "off": 28264,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "慶喜様！\\n面白いなどと\\nそのような――",
   "en": "Yoshinobu-sama!\\nTo call it\\namusing, of\\nall things--",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0437"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x74d4",
   "off": 29908,
   "max": 16,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "いいじゃないか",
   "en": "What's the harm?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0438"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x79fc",
   "off": 31228,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "太古より存在し\\nその強大な力故に\\n封じられし超魂……",
   "en": "The Ultra Soul,\\nwhich has\\nexisted since\\nancient times\\nand was sealed\\naway for its\\nimmense power...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0439"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x7a44",
   "off": 31300,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それが　五つに砕け\\nこの日本に\\n散らばった……",
   "en": "...shattered into\\nfive and scattered\\nacross Japan...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x043a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x7ef0",
   "off": 32496,
   "max": 16,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "預言によれば",
   "en": "According to\\nthe prophecy...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x043b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x87f4",
   "off": 34804,
   "max": 60,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "超魂を持つ者が\\n立ち上がったとき\\n時代が大きく変わる……",
   "en": "...when one who\\nholds the Ultra\\nSoul rises, the\\nera will change\\ngreatly...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x043c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x8dcc",
   "off": 36300,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "つまり　徳川の世が終わる\\nそうだったね？　直弼",
   "en": "In other words,\\nthe age of the\\nTokugawa will\\nend. Isn't that\\nright, Naosuke?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x043d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x9440",
   "off": 37952,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "はい\\nしかしご安心下さい\\nすでに男は死に",
   "en": "Yes. But rest\\nassured. The man\\nis already dead...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x043e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x947c",
   "off": 38012,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "片魂も　二度と\\n超魂に戻ることは\\nございません",
   "en": "...and the Piece\\nSouls shall never\\nagain become\\nthe Ultra Soul.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x043f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x9da0",
   "off": 40352,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "この　直弼",
   "en": "For I, Naosuke...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0440"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xa2c4",
   "off": 41668,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "片魂のひとつに\\n呪いをかけて\\nおりまする",
   "en": "...have placed a\\ncurse upon one of\\nthe Piece Souls.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0441"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xaa10",
   "off": 43536,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "呪い？",
   "en": "A curse?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0442"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xb0b4",
   "off": 45236,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "徳川を守護する我らに\\n伝わる秘術",
   "en": "A secret art\\nhanded down\\namong us who\\nguard the\\nTokugawa.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0443"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xb8e8",
   "off": 47336,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "千塵万華\\n（オルターソウル）\\nでござります",
   "en": "The Alter Soul.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0444"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xc178",
   "off": 49528,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "千塵万華？",
   "en": "The Alter Soul?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0445"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xc600",
   "off": 50688,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "御神祖様が\\n戦国の世を平定するおり\\n使われた秘術――",
   "en": "The secret art our\\ndivine founder\\nused when he\\nbrought peace to\\nthe Warring\\nStates era--",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0446"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xc648",
   "off": 50760,
   "max": 56,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "その秘術に　私めが\\n独自の改良を施した術で\\nございます",
   "en": "--to which I have\\napplied\\nimprovements of\\nmy own devising.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0447"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xc690",
   "off": 50832,
   "max": 60,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "千塵万華を受けた者は\\n歌の才能を強制的に\\n引き出され――",
   "en": "One struck by\\nthe Alter Soul\\nhas their talent\\nfor song forcibly\\ndrawn out--",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0448"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xcfc0",
   "off": 53184,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "そして　得た力と\\n引き替えに\\n魂が朽ち果てるのです",
   "en": "--and in exchange\\nfor the power\\ngained, their soul\\nrots away.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0449"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xd714",
   "off": 55060,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "身体に宿した片魂ごと\\n腐り果てるというのかい",
   "en": "You mean they\\nrot away, along\\nwith the Piece\\nSoul within\\ntheir body?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x044a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xdde0",
   "off": 56800,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "御意",
   "en": "Just so, my lord.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x044b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xe5c8",
   "off": 58824,
   "max": 60,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それまでの間\\nその者の呪われた歌は\\n幕府の力となりましょう",
   "en": "Until then, that\\nperson's cursed\\nsong shall serve\\nthe shogunate's\\npower...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x044c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xe614",
   "off": 58900,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "他の片魂の持ち主を\\n引き寄せるのです",
   "en": "...drawing in the\\nholders of the\\nother Piece Souls.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x044d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xeab8",
   "off": 60088,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "そういうものなのか",
   "en": "Is that how\\nit works?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x044e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xeadc",
   "off": 60124,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "あとは　この掌中へと\\n集うて来るのを待つのみ",
   "en": "All that remains\\nis to wait for\\nthem to gather\\ninto our hands.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x044f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xef88",
   "off": 61320,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それと……",
   "en": "And another\\nthing...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0450"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xf410",
   "off": 62480,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "まだ\\n何かあるのかい？",
   "en": "There's\\nsomething more?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0451"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0xfd1c",
   "off": 64796,
   "max": 60,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "正体不明の三人組が\\n街中でロックの雷舞を\\n行ったようです",
   "en": "It seems a trio\\nof unknown\\nidentity held a\\nrock live in the\\nmiddle of town.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0452"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x1062c",
   "off": 67116,
   "max": 28,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "本当に\\nそれはまことか！",
   "en": "Really? You\\nmean it!",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0453"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x10c8c",
   "off": 68748,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "慶喜様\\nそのようなお顔を\\nなさいますな",
   "en": "Yoshinobu-sama,\\nplease do not\\nmake such a face.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0454"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x111cc",
   "off": 70092,
   "max": 40,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ああ　ごめん\\nでもね　直弼\\n予は……",
   "en": "Ah, sorry. But\\nyou know,\\nNaosuke, I...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0455"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x11670",
   "off": 71280,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "それ以上は\\n仰いますな",
   "en": "Say no more,\\nmy lord.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0456"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x11b04",
   "off": 72452,
   "max": 12,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "……うん",
   "en": "...All right.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0457"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x12028",
   "off": 73768,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "心配には及びません",
   "en": "There is no need\\nfor concern.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0458"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x124b8",
   "off": 74936,
   "max": 48,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "その三人が仮に片魂の\\n持ち主であったとしても",
   "en": "Even if those\\nthree should\\nhold Piece Souls...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0459"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x12594",
   "off": 75156,
   "max": 36,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ひとつは我が幕府側に\\nあるのです",
   "en": "...one of the Piece\\nSouls is on the\\nshogunate's side.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x045a"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x12a34",
   "off": 76340,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "そうか……そうだね\\n予は心配なんて\\nしていないよ",
   "en": "I see... Yes, of\\ncourse. I'm not\\nworried at all.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x045b"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x131f0",
   "off": 78320,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ただね\\n予は……",
   "en": "It's just... I...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x045c"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x132b0",
   "off": 78512,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "いや\\nなんでもない",
   "en": "No, never mind.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x045d"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x13aa4",
   "off": 80548,
   "max": 52,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "ただ　心配ないとはいえ\\n野放しにもしておけませぬ",
   "en": "Even so, we\\ncannot leave them\\nrunning loose,\\nconcern or no.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x045e"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x13ff0",
   "off": 81904,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "えっ",
   "en": "Huh?",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x045f"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x14474",
   "off": 83060,
   "max": 44,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "既に　三人に追っ手を\\n差し向けております",
   "en": "I have already\\nsent pursuers\\nafter the three.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0460"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x149b8",
   "off": 84408,
   "max": 8,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "そうか",
   "en": "I see.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0461"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x14a6c",
   "off": 84588,
   "max": 20,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "わかった\\n任せる",
   "en": "Very well. I\\nleave it to you.",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0462"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x1537c",
   "off": 86908,
   "max": 24,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "全ては\\n世の泰平のため",
   "en": "All for the peace\\nof the realm...",
   "op": "0x62",
   "msg": "0x0463"
  },
  {
   "id": "m_002001:0x153b4",
   "off": 86964,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "jp": "そして\\n我が慶喜様の御為に――",
   "en": "...and for the\\nsake of my\\nYoshinobu-sama--",
   "op": "0x62",
